# S-044: the "Video stopped" summary computes the percentage as skipped / total * 100 in floating point; with total 0
# the quotient is infinite and the line prints "inf%". The counters are plain 32-bit-visible values read as C long.
vopen v I420 30 1 16 8 2
vconnect v a 1
vtex v skipped
vtex v skipped
vtex v frames
vdisconnect v a 1
vconnect v a 1
vtex v skipped
vdisconnect v a 1
vclose v
